subscripts).

I'm not sure what are we arguing, though.

I agree that SE conversion doesn't change the meaning of the _selbri_.

However, the order of the sumti does change the meaning of the _bridi_.

If this is not true, then give the correct rule. All you've said is
that {ro prenu cu prami su'o prenu} should mean the same as {su'o prenu
cu se prami ro prenu}, but you haven't given the rule to interpret
scopes in general.

